Subject: [native] re-anchor classic WiFi virtual clock on reconstructed source

Context port of peripheral 0093 over the existing offline-radio lifecycle
and channel layout. Keep its additional lifecycle rearm sites on the same
virtual clock as the migrated timers. No guest or RF PASS is implied.

